          "title": "You'll want to know: ملازم",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ملازم — mulāzim — \"an employee\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ملازم (mulāzim) is a loan from Arabic mulāzim, \"one who keeps close, an attendant\", which reached Urdu through Persian. Its Arabic root is l-z-m (Lane)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
